### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Get all users
GET {{host}}/users

### Get user by id
GET {{host}}/users/1

### Create user
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com"
}

### Update user
PUT {{host}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Updated",
  "email": "jane.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{host}}/users/1
